articles.text:
(a) indishyi nsimburagihombo cyangwa
iz’ibyo yari kuzunguka;
(b) indishyi z’impozamarira z’ububabare;
(c) indishyi z’ubusembwa ku mubiri;
(d) indishyi zo gutakaza amahirwe yo
gushaka;
(e) indishyi zo gutakaza amahirwe
y’akazi.
(2) Iteka rya Minisitiri ufite ubuzima mu
nshingano rishyiraho ibikurikizwa mu
kugena igipimo cy’ubumuga mu Rwanda.
